# Join the Dead ({1}{B}{B} instant): "Target creature gets -5/-5 until end of turn. Descend 4 - That creature gets -10/-10 until end of turn instead if there are four or more permanent
# cards in your graveyard" (CR 207.2c, 700.11, 614.1a). Bot1's graveyard on turn 3: Faithless Looting (a sorcery, not a permanent card) and the two Islands it discarded, then a sacrificed
# Black Lotus: exactly three permanent cards, one short of descend 4. Bot2's graveyard holds a Black Lotus too, which is not Bot1's and does not count (counting it would make four and kill the
# Elder Gargaroth). So Bot2's 6/6 Elder Gargaroth is -5/-5 only: a 1/1 that lives, back to 6/6 on the next turn (CR 514.2). The spell costs exactly {1}{B}{B}.
